📨 Stage 1 Resolution
The Problem

Docker image inferenced:0.2.4 couldn't sync from genesis:
Error: AppHash mismatch
Error: Trust period expired (77 days)
Result: New nodes blocked from joining

The Solution (Gonka Team)
“Version v0.2.4 can be used to load from snapshots after v0.2.4. The quickstart instruction deploys from snapshot automatically.”
Key insight: Use snapshot-based deployment, not genesis sync.
Official method:
   cd ~/gonka/deploy/join
   docker compose up -d  # Auto-loads snapshot ✅
Impact: Turned a 12-hour blocker into a <1 hour fix.




