🚀 Deployment Steps
1. Chain Node (Hetzner)

Clean and prepare:
    cd ~/gonka/deploy/join
    docker compose down
    sudo rm -rf .inference/data
    sudo mkdir -p .inference/data

Verify genesis:
    curl -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gonka-ai/gonka/main/genesis/genesis.json -o genesis.json
    sha256sum genesis.json
  # Expected: 47ab596779fce181882bfcc62c7588947a76ac9d0f49d87cb3a6336ae59ff210
    sudo cp genesis.json .inference/config/genesis.json

Configure state sync:
cat > config.env << 'EOF'
SEED_NODE_RPC_URL=http://node2.gonka.ai:26657
SEED_NODE_P2P_URL=tcp://node2.gonka.ai:5000
SYNC_WITH_SNAPSHOTS=true
TRUSTED_BLOCK_PERIOD=2000
EOF

Launch:
   export $(grep -v '^#' config.env | xargs)
docker compose up -d

Verify sync:
   curl -s localhost:26657/status | jq '.result.sync_info'
# catching_up: false ✅




