🎓 Lessons Learned
Key Insights
Use Snapshot Deployment
   v0.2.4 requires snapshots, not genesis sync
   Official docker-compose handles this automatically

Tailscale Fixes Networking Limits
   Vast.ai blocks many inbound ports
   Tailscale provides a stable encrypted VPN mesh

Separate Keys for Security
   Cold key (offline) for governance and high-value ops
   Warm key (server) for daily operations
   authz enables safe delegation

Automation Prevents Downtime
   Watchdog scripts auto-restart services
   Docker healthchecks enable automatic recovery
   Monitoring detects issues early

Epoch Assignment is Random
   Not all nodes are selected each epoch
   Register before epoch start to maximize chances
   STOPPED status ≠ misconfiguration

Best Practices
   ✅ Document while building – capture commands and errors immediately
   ✅ Test each component early – chain, API, ML node, VPN
   ✅ Use exact model IDs – governance matching is strict
   ✅ Monitor continuously – “automated” ≠ “forget about it”
   ✅ Leverage community support – GitHub issues and Discord save time





